                "source_path": "PIAs/ati-schedule-i-economic-development-agency-of-canada-for-the-regions-of-quebec/pia-b8a441a1a47a_en.md",
                "line": 127,
                "mention": "PSU 914",
                "method": "explicit_pib_id",
                "excerpt": "This information is collected to capture conversations (e.g. questions and answers, comments, ‘likes’ and retweets) between you and CED. It may be used to respond to enquiries or for statistical evaluation and reporting purposes. Comments posted that violate Canadian law will be deleted and disclosed to law enforcement authorities. Comments that violate our rules of engagement will also be deleted. The personal information is included in Personal Information Bank PSU 914 and PSU 938.” »"
              },
              {
                "language": "en",
                "source_path": "PIAs/ati-schedule-i-economic-development-agency-of-canada-for-the-regions-of-quebec/pia-b8a441a1a47a_en.md",
                "line": 137,
                "mention": "PSU 914",
                "method": "explicit_pib_id",
                "excerpt": "CED will identify the presence of personal information collected through official social media accounts in Personal Information Bank PSU 914 (Public Communications) and PSU 938 (Outreach Activities) and will publish an annual report in Info Source on all personal information holdings, in compliance with the Policy on Privacy Protection."
              },
